# One repository, two manifests, one list. No interaction — the point is the
# header line and that cargo's commands sit in the same groups as npm's.
Output "../../assets/ecosystems.gif"
Set Width 1000
Set Height 620
Source config.tape

Hide
Type "cd /tmp/opi-demo/pulse" Enter
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Sleep 800ms
Type "opi" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 5s
